#: ../../language/error_codes/E4229.md:1
msgid "E4229"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4229.md:3
msgid ""
"`#alias` is not supported on `declare fn` or `declare let` declarations. "
"These declarations describe an interface without providing its "
"implementation."
msgstr "`declare fn` 和 `declare let` 声明不支持 `#alias`。这些声明只描述接口，不提供实现。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4229.md:6
msgid "Erroneous example"
msgstr "错误示例"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4229.md:8
msgid ""
"///|\n"
"#alias(old_name)\n"
"declare pub fn new_name() -> Int32\n"
"\n"
"///|\n"
"pub fn new_name() -> Int32 {\n"
"  42\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4229.md:12
msgid "Suggestion"
msgstr "建议"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4229.md:14
msgid ""
"Move `#alias` to the corresponding function or value definition. If the "
"alias is part of a declaration-based interface, declare its name separately."
" The declarations check the signatures, not whether one name is implemented "
"as an alias of the other."
msgstr ""
"`#alias` 应移到对应的函数或值的定义上。如果别名属于基于声明的接口，请单独声明其名称。声明检查签名，不检查一个名称是否实现为另一个名称的别名。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4229.md:19
msgid ""
"///|\n"
"declare pub fn new_name() -> Int32\n"
"\n"
"///|\n"
"declare pub fn old_name() -> Int32\n"
"\n"
"///|\n"
"#alias(old_name)\n"
"pub fn new_name() -> Int32 {\n"
"  42\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
